@startuml 03d-modulos-reservas-pagos-vuelos
' Módulos Reservations (incluye Payments y Policies) y Flights, con sus dependencias cruzadas reales.
' Evidencia: Modules/Reservations/**, Modules/Flights/**, ReservationsModuleExtensions.cs,
' FlightsModuleExtensions.cs (selección de proveedor por Flights:Provider).
!pragma layout smetana
!include ../_tema.iuml
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 50

title Backend — reservas, pagos simulados y vuelos (con el ciclo Reservations ↔ Flights)

package "Reservations" #FFF8EE {
  class ReservationsController <<Controller · /api/reservations · TOURIST>> #E3F2FD
  class CompanyReservationsController <<Controller · /api/companies/me/reservations · PROVIDER>> #E3F2FD
  class AdminPaymentsController <<Controller · /api/admin · ADMIN>> #E3F2FD
  class ReservationService <<IReservationService>> #E8F5E9
  class ReservationBookingService <<IReservationBookingService>> #E8F5E9
  class ReservationCancellationService <<IReservationCancellationService>> #E8F5E9
  class ReservationExpirationService <<IReservationExpirationService>> #E8F5E9
  class AdminPaymentsService <<IAdminPaymentsService>> #E8F5E9
  class PaymentLedger <<IPaymentLedger>> #E8F5E9
  class SimulatedPaymentGateway <<IPaymentGateway · SIMULADO>> #FFE0B2
  class "CancellationPolicy\nCancellationPolicyRules" as Policy <<Policies · estático>> #F5F5F5
  class ReservationRepository <<IReservationRepository>> #FFF8E1
  class ReservationItemRepository <<IReservationItemRepository>> #FFF8E1
}

package "Flights" #FDF0F4 {
  class PackageFlightRulesController <<Controller · /api/packages/{id}/flight-rule>> #E3F2FD
  class PackageFlightQuotesController <<Controller · flight-quotes · TOURIST>> #E3F2FD
  class AirportsController <<Controller · /api/airports · anónimo>> #E3F2FD
  class PackageFlightService <<IPackageFlightService>> #E8F5E9
  class FlightBookingOrchestrator <<IFlightBookingOrchestrator>> #E8F5E9
  class FlightReconciliationService <<IFlightReconciliationService>> #E8F5E9
  interface IFlightProvider #FFFFFF
  class FakeFlightProvider <<por defecto · sin red>> #FFE0B2
  class DuffelFlightProvider <<Flights:Provider=Duffel · sólo token TEST>> #FCE4EC
  class AirportCatalog <<estático>> #F5F5F5
}

package "Otros módulos" #FAFAFA {
  class ExperienceAvailabilityRepository <<Experiences>> #EEEEEE
  class PackageAvailabilityRepository <<Packages>> #EEEEEE
  class CompanyOwnershipGuard <<Security>> #E1F5FE
}

ReservationsController --> ReservationService : crear, listar,\npagar, cancelar
ReservationsController --> ReservationCancellationService : cancellation-quote
CompanyReservationsController --> ReservationService : recibidas,\ncancelar ítem
AdminPaymentsController --> AdminPaymentsService : libro y cola\nde cancelaciones
AdminPaymentsController --> ReservationCancellationService : POST\ncancellations/resolve

ReservationService --> ReservationRepository
ReservationService --> ReservationItemRepository
ReservationService --> ExperienceAvailabilityRepository
ReservationService --> PackageAvailabilityRepository
ReservationService --> ReservationBookingService : holds de cupo
ReservationService --> SimulatedPaymentGateway : Charge / Void
ReservationService --> PaymentLedger : RecordCharge,\nRecordVoid
ReservationService --> ReservationCancellationService
ReservationService --> FlightBookingOrchestrator : Preflight, BeginOrdering,\nPlaceOrder, Apply
ReservationService --> CompanyOwnershipGuard
ReservationService ..> Policy : congela la política\nen reservation_items

ReservationBookingService --> ReservationRepository
ReservationExpirationService --> ReservationRepository
ReservationExpirationService --> ReservationBookingService : libera cupo
ReservationCancellationService --> ReservationRepository
ReservationCancellationService --> ReservationBookingService : libera cupo
ReservationCancellationService --> IFlightProvider : Quote/Confirm\nCancellation
ReservationCancellationService --> SimulatedPaymentGateway : Refund
ReservationCancellationService --> PaymentLedger : RecordRefund
ReservationCancellationService ..> Policy
AdminPaymentsService --> PaymentLedger : saldo por moneda

PackageFlightRulesController --> PackageFlightService
PackageFlightQuotesController --> PackageFlightService : cotizar,\nrevalidar
AirportsController ..> AirportCatalog
PackageFlightService --> IFlightProvider : SearchAsync,\nRefreshOfferAsync
PackageFlightService --> CompanyOwnershipGuard
FlightBookingOrchestrator --> IFlightProvider : RefreshOffer,\nCreateOrder
FlightReconciliationService --> IFlightProvider : GetOrder, FindOrderByOffer,\nQuote/ConfirmCancellation
FlightReconciliationService --> FlightBookingOrchestrator
FlightReconciliationService --> ReservationBookingService : libera cupo si\nno hubo emisión
FlightReconciliationService --> SimulatedPaymentGateway : Void

FakeFlightProvider ..|> IFlightProvider
DuffelFlightProvider ..|> IFlightProvider

legend bottom right
  Sólo UNA implementación de IFlightProvider se registra, según Flights:Provider (default "Fake").
  IPaymentGateway tiene una única implementación: SimulatedPaymentGateway (el resultado
  lo decide el campo "success" de PayReservationRequest; nunca mueve dinero).
  Dependencia circular entre módulos: Reservations usa IFlightBookingOrchestrator/IFlightProvider
  y Flights usa IReservationBookingService/IPaymentGateway. La resuelve el contenedor de DI
  porque ningún constructor depende de sí mismo transitivamente.
endlegend
@enduml
